# Language (English)

**English is the primary language** for this monorepo. Write and maintain everything in English unless a file explicitly documents another locale.

| Layer | Language |
|-------|----------|
| Code comments (JSDoc, PHPDoc) | English |
| User-facing UI (`apps/*`, `@ellr/ui`) | English |
| API messages consumed by the frontend | English |
| `getApiErrorMessage` mappings | English |
| All documentation (`*.md`, `*.mdc`, `README`, `AGENTS.md`, `.cursor/`) | English |
| Cursor rules, PR/commit prose | English |
| Tests (assertions on visible copy) | English |

## Exceptions

- Third-party SDK or framework docs quoted verbatim
- `backend/features/*.feature` Gherkin: English (align with API copy)

## Agent routine

1. Do not add French strings to new code, comments, or rules.
2. When touching a file that still has French copy, translate it in the same change.
3. Keep error `code` values stable (`registration_disabled`, etc.); only translate human `message` fields.
